exports[`driver.route.dispute-passage.journey.acceptance given: [case4] a route with a fulcrum that has no frontmatter when: [t0] the stop hook runs route.drive then: the lint a driver reads is pinned: the stop holds on a fulcrum with no frontmatter 1`] = `
"✋ ConstraintError: a fulcrum is unreadable or forged; repair each before the stop

🗿 route.fulcrum lint: F002 has unreadable frontmatter
   ├─ file: .fulcrums/inventory.of=fulcrums.case=F002-no-frontmatter.md
   ├─ absent
   │  ├─ case
   │  ├─ rework
   │  ├─ ground
   │  ├─ confidence
   │  ├─ status
   │  ├─ owed
   │  ├─ holds
   │  ├─ lean
   │  └─ verdict
   └─ fix: the frontmatter opens the file, with every field of
      ├─ case · rework · ground · confidence · status · owed · holds · lean · verdict
      └─ paste, at the head of the file
         ├─
         │  ---
         │  case: F002
         │  rework: clean            # clean | dirty
         │  ground: wrong            # wrong | dirty
         │  confidence: 0.65         # the weakest call it holds, 0 to 1
         │  status: open             # open | held | ruled | superseded
         │  owed: none               # none, until a dispute cites it: then human | reflect
         │  holds: []                # each concern a dispute cites, e.g. rules/i003/blocker.2
         │  lean: <one line — the call you made>
         │  verdict: null            # only rhx route.fulcrum.rule writes this
         │  ---
         └─

---
